---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout title="Solution" description="GOTYOU brings the data-driven power of e-commerce to local businesses. Personalized offers, real-time rewards, and AI-powered campaigns.">
  <div class="page-hero">
    <div class="eyebrow" style="justify-content: center;">
      <span class="token-trail"><span class="dot"></span><span class="dot"></span><span class="dot"></span><span class="dot"></span></span>
      Business Solution
    </div>
    <h1>Transform Your Customer Connections</h1>
    <p class="lede">Empower Local Commerce with Personalized Connections.</p>
  </div>

  <div class="section">
    <div class="content-narrow">
      <p>GOTYOU brings the data-driven power of e-commerce to local businesses. Just like Amazon personalizes offers that reach customers daily, GOTYOU gives local merchants the ability to reach consumers with the right deals at the right time. No more juggling multiple loyalty apps, email signups, or SMS campaigns—everything happens seamlessly through our platform, right at the point of transaction.</p>

      <div style="text-align: center; margin: 1.6rem 0;">
        <a href="/pricing" class="btn-primary">
          Merchant Pricing
          <svg width="15" height="15" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.4" style="vertical-align:-2px"><line x1="5" y1="12" x2="19" y2="12" /><polyline points="12 5 19 12 12 19" /></svg>
        </a>
      </div>

      <h2>Really begin to know your customers.</h2>
      <p>Our permission-based system allows you to gain valuable insights from your customers, helping you truly understand their habits and needs. Create customized engagements to boost revenue, increase customer visits, and foster loyalty.</p>
      <p>Our AI-powered search engine optimizes based on comprehensive user profiles, geolocation, and past history. Even Google and Facebook won't give you this level of permission-based engagement.</p>

      <img src="/images/solution-campaigns.png" alt="GOTYOU campaigns dashboard" />

      <h2>Enhance Customer Experience, Boost Sales</h2>
      <p>GOTYOU's automation and AI engine analyze customer behavior to identify engagement opportunities, tailored for retail stores and restaurants. By personalizing interactions and offering timely incentives, it brings customers back more often. GOTYOU bridges the gap between digital experiences and in-store visits, fostering loyalty and boosting sales.</p>

      <div style="display:flex; gap: 1rem; flex-wrap: wrap; margin-top: 1.5rem;">
        <a href="https://app.gotyou.co/sign-up" class="btn-primary">
          Get Started
          <svg width="15" height="15" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.4" style="vertical-align:-2px"><line x1="5" y1="12" x2="19" y2="12" /><polyline points="12 5 19 12 12 19" /></svg>
        </a>
        <a href="/pricing" class="btn-ghost">Pricing</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
